---

This repository contains security research against hardware the researcher
owns. The DEF CON 34 badge's designer publicly invited attacks on it. Findings
here are published so they can be fixed; nothing in this repository targets
anyone else's device.

Firmware and RTL quoted in the documentation belong to their respective
authors (Baochip / bunnie / the Xous project) and are reproduced in short
excerpts for the purpose of identifying and explaining defects.
